{
  "applied_operation_id": "op_a377881bc4524428b38359e072af184b",
  "claims": [
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_6cbb7b7948fd85ddcd4b6c2fd6f6ce818de2b3880fa7cfe0d1713ef7dc8e2060",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "specifications",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "d607f56c9cfe9e8632ebaf65dcaf2b4b7fe1c6f8",
          "git_sha": "bc93de200040127aac2db6fb9c4dc9a8f2ec283e",
          "line_end": 14,
          "line_start": 13,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "xingyaoww/code-act",
          "url": "https://github.com/xingyaoww/code-act/blob/d607f56c9cfe9e8632ebaf65dcaf2b4b7fe1c6f8/README.md#L13-L14"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_8d894dba73799d0b9f2d6f1cdb9346b596abf03bbed136f47a1de2076b8c1a58"
      ],
      "text": "CodeAct consolidates LLM agent actions into a unified action space using executable code, integrated with a Python interpreter so the agent can revise prior actions or emit new ones based on execution results across multi-turn interactions."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_20861860fad0c266f19753fb21eba6da67fc23bf6f95c6ecc6df048cc3e6b750",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "d607f56c9cfe9e8632ebaf65dcaf2b4b7fe1c6f8",
          "git_sha": "bc93de200040127aac2db6fb9c4dc9a8f2ec283e",
          "line_end": 71,
          "line_start": 67,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "xingyaoww/code-act",
          "url": "https://github.com/xingyaoww/code-act/blob/d607f56c9cfe9e8632ebaf65dcaf2b4b7fe1c6f8/README.md#L67-L71"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_782469b32f30e0471059c7c11fe53418bce274a13ba557a52b7001950baa10e0"
      ],
      "text": "A CodeActAgent system comprises an LLM serving layer (e.g., vLLM exposing an OpenAI-compatible API), an interaction interface (chat-ui with MongoDB history or a simple Python script), and a code execution engine service."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_be833915e75abae8de582004c37af8fd9ea67b53e6648bd8f0ad8460d02a7756",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "d607f56c9cfe9e8632ebaf65dcaf2b4b7fe1c6f8",
          "git_sha": "bc93de200040127aac2db6fb9c4dc9a8f2ec283e",
          "line_end": 146,
          "line_start": 146,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "xingyaoww/code-act",
          "url": "https://github.com/xingyaoww/code-act/blob/d607f56c9cfe9e8632ebaf65dcaf2b4b7fe1c6f8/README.md#L146-L146"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_334e739bcb886070124539480f62bd5556cb92175a6e21c694b5bee336d80814"
      ],
      "text": "The code execution engine is built on JupyterKernelGateway and starts a Jupyter server inside a Docker container per chat session to serve code execution requests, with sessions timing out after a fixed period."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_3491975c3f530622f979c934f4e9d964cbef512a3a7389751f3896868e66ffcf",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "d607f56c9cfe9e8632ebaf65dcaf2b4b7fe1c6f8",
          "git_sha": "bc93de200040127aac2db6fb9c4dc9a8f2ec283e",
          "line_end": 162,
          "line_start": 161,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "xingyaoww/code-act",
          "url": "https://github.com/xingyaoww/code-act/blob/d607f56c9cfe9e8632ebaf65dcaf2b4b7fe1c6f8/README.md#L161-L162"
        },
        {
          "commit": "d607f56c9cfe9e8632ebaf65dcaf2b4b7fe1c6f8",
          "git_sha": "bc93de200040127aac2db6fb9c4dc9a8f2ec283e",
          "line_end": 151,
          "line_start": 150,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "xingyaoww/code-act",
          "url": "https://github.com/xingyaoww/code-act/blob/d607f56c9cfe9e8632ebaf65dcaf2b4b7fe1c6f8/README.md#L150-L151"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_471e04837d85429d55ea06e7b6274a2f89b119836c7eeea35acfa790e86a1382",
        "slc_ba9efce1fd403e2db1fbd457a9050279d19aa8a866ba677c5f44871a734af7b9"
      ],
      "text": "The code execution engine exposes an HTTP endpoint (example port 8081 via start_jupyter_server.sh) that the demo Python script consumes through a jupyter_kernel_url /execute path."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_f8fd70f16858d7279a3eac3e3a11c4d6d928a92ab3fe64b4752d394a8dfe991d",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "evaluation",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "d607f56c9cfe9e8632ebaf65dcaf2b4b7fe1c6f8",
          "git_sha": "bc93de200040127aac2db6fb9c4dc9a8f2ec283e",
          "line_end": 30,
          "line_start": 30,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "xingyaoww/code-act",
          "url": "https://github.com/xingyaoww/code-act/blob/d607f56c9cfe9e8632ebaf65dcaf2b4b7fe1c6f8/README.md#L30-L30"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_b154c4e415800ce0721450020ddfa01fda6f4ca9c555350766e030a6210ae4c5"
      ],
      "text": "The paper's analysis covers 17 LLMs on API-Bank and a newly curated M3ToolEval benchmark, reporting CodeAct outperforming Text and JSON action formats by up to 20% higher success rate."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_d2a39cc692b63bda89c9781c7c5f8a4f571f456c5e6b45f10a9c29ed690d3768",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "evaluation",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "d607f56c9cfe9e8632ebaf65dcaf2b4b7fe1c6f8",
          "git_sha": "e20fe299b09c795926cbf35038e4bf3dd5ebb53a",
          "line_end": 57,
          "line_start": 57,
          "path": "docs/EVALUATION.md",
          "repository": "xingyaoww/code-act",
          "url": "https://github.com/xingyaoww/code-act/blob/d607f56c9cfe9e8632ebaf65dcaf2b4b7fe1c6f8/docs/EVALUATION.md#L57-L57"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_84eb725f170c6297d8bfe1fdb0b833e18f4d206c65d0402cfe203cd4ac04543f"
      ],
      "text": "MT-Bench evaluation requires an OPENAI_API_KEY because it uses GPT-4 as the judge; the corresponding lines in the mint-bench script can be commented out to disable it."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_1bf43c288d3cc85b46c2e7c13a964952699f9ca39ef535c1e80f2281a9902a1e",
